Kumar_)_01.jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=143138192","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"Acqua Di Parma Boutique Barberia\n<p>Via Ges\u00f9, 1, 20121 Milano\nLombardy, Italy\n</p><p>Acqua Di Parma is a famous manufacturer of fragrance and personal care products based in Milan, Italy also offering products including cologne essence, shaving products, face wash and hair care products.\n</p><p>It has been the a subsidiary of the French luxury goods conglomerate LMVH (LVMH Mo\u00ebt Hennessy Louis Vuitton) since 2001.\n</p><p>History of the brand ( Source: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.acquadiparma.com/en/gb/about-us/\">https://www.acquadiparma.com/en/gb/about-us/</a>) - \n</p><p>Created in 1916 by the Italian baron Carlo Magnani from Parma as his own personal Colonia/Cologne, Acqua di Parma today is a symbol of Italian sophistication, discreet luxury, and craftsmanship that is inspired by its heritage and yet constantly evolving to always stay relevant and meaningful.\nIn the 1950s, Colonia attained international success, when Hollywood actors, invited to Italy by the great masters of Italian cinema, discovered its intimate and refined notes in the historic bespoke tailors\u2019 shops. Today, Acqua di Parma is a leading player on the luxury market, thanks to the production of a series of true masterpieces of traditional Italian craftsmanship.\n</p>\nRecognising the importance of our workspace and its impact on the environment and the wellbeing of employees, our headquarters are ISO14001 certified in recognition of our sustainable practices","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"Ank Kumar","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY-SA 4.0","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}}}]},"143138190":{"pageid":143138190,"ns":6,"title":"File:2014 - Acqua Di Parma Boutique Barberia, Milan, Italy ( Ank Kumar ) 02.jpg","index":6,"imagerepository":"local","image